# Bitacora git attributes.
#
# Source files are normalised to LF on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are test inputs whose exact bytes matter (CRLF, BOM, tabs, trailing
# whitespace). `-text` disables EOL conversion and BOM handling on checkout
# (also with core.autocrlf=true on Windows). We keep `diff` enabled so Markdown
# fixtures stay reviewable; only `linguist-vendored` hides them from language
# statistics. Integrity is enforced by `cargo xtask fixtures verify`.
fixtures/** -text linguist-vendored

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
